  "_comment": "Copy to ConnectionStrings.Production.json on the server and fill in. That copy is gitignored; never commit credentials. Every environment except Development reads this file (IIS runs as Production unless ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT says otherwise). The database is FreightEstimator; production does not use UPSRate.",
